{
  "id": "b01",
  "title": "A Story from Grandma's Farm",
  "titleZh": "奶奶家农场的故事",
  "topic": "家庭",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "One cold weekday, a kind madam gives us a task.",
        "zh": "一个寒冷的平日，一位好心的女士给我们布置了一个任务。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our exam asks us to translate one old family story.",
        "zh": "我们的考试要我们翻译一个古老的家庭故事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We may retell it, or draw it with a crayon.",
        "zh": "我们可以复述它，也可以用蜡笔把它画出来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The rules are simple: never cheat, and never fool oneself.",
        "zh": "规则很简单：绝不作弊，也绝不欺骗自己。"
      },
      {
        "en": "After class, the lively children run to the old playground.",
        "zh": "下课后，活泼的孩子们跑向那个旧操场。"
      },
      {
        "en": "For a minute, I only hear the sound of their feet.",
        "zh": "有那么一分钟，我只听到他们脚步的声音。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "On Saturday, Mom takes me toward the northern hills.",
        "zh": "周六，妈妈带我朝北边的山丘走去。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A driver stops his motorcycle and asks me the way.",
        "zh": "一位司机停下摩托车，向我问路。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The long trip might take an hour, maybe even two.",
        "zh": "这趟长路可能要一个小时，也许甚至两个小时。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We ride past fields of green wheat in the sun.",
        "zh": "我们在阳光下骑着车经过一片片绿色的麦田。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A helpful stranger waves at us from a small white house.",
        "zh": "一位乐于助人的陌生人从一座白色小房子里朝我们挥手。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Grandma waits by the gate, and her warm smile satisfies me.",
        "zh": "奶奶在门口等着，她温暖的笑容让我心里很满足。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My grandmother keeps a warm kitchen with one old fridge.",
        "zh": "我的祖母有一间温暖的厨房，里面放着一台旧冰箱。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I am hungry and thirsty, so she gives me a hotdog.",
        "zh": "我又饿又渴，于是她给了我一个热狗。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She also makes a thin pancake and warm noodle soup.",
        "zh": "她还做了一张薄煎饼和热乎乎的汤面。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Pork, biscuit and fruit all taste delicious on that table.",
        "zh": "猪肉、饼干和水果在那张桌子上吃起来都很美味。"
      },
      {
        "en": "After lunch, I tidy the shelf under a low ceiling.",
        "zh": "午饭后，我把低矮天花板下的架子整理干净。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Grandpa leads me to the yard and shows me the rabbit.",
        "zh": "爷爷把我领到院子里，给我看那只兔子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A goose and a frog sit quietly near an old rope.",
        "zh": "一只鹅和一只青蛙安静地待在一根旧绳子旁边。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Bees hum softly, and a butterfly rests on my glove.",
        "zh": "蜜蜂轻轻地嗡嗡叫，一只蝴蝶落在我的手套上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My legs ache as he tells a wolf story.",
        "zh": "他讲狼的故事时，我的腿隐隐作痛。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His book shows a camel and a whale by the sea.",
        "zh": "他的书里画着一头骆驼和一头海边的鲸鱼。"
      },
      {
        "en": "That night, I take a shower and clean the small toilet.",
        "zh": "那天晚上，我洗了个澡，还打扫了那个小厕所。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "I say pardon for my rubber shoes on the clean floor.",
        "zh": "我的胶鞋踩在干净的地板上，我说了声抱歉。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then I fold my scarf and tidy my small bag.",
        "zh": "然后我叠好围巾，把我那个小包整理好。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Back at school, I retell a story about a cloned sheep.",
        "zh": "回到学校，我复述了一个关于克隆羊的故事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The swimming team has training every morning after class.",
        "zh": "游泳队每天上午下课后都要训练。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My teacher's kind words sound warm and satisfy me.",
        "zh": "老师亲切的话语听起来很温暖，让我很满足。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Next week, another exam asks us to retell a story.",
        "zh": "下周，又有一场考试要我们复述一个故事。"
      }
    ]
  ],
